ac.rending.essence_aw=Abyssal Wasteland Essences are made from harvesting Abyssal Wasteland Energy from Coralium entities.
ac.rending.essence_dl=Dreadlands Essences are made from harvesting Dreadlands Energy from Dread entities.
ac.rending.essence_omt=Omothol Essences are made from harvesting Omothol Energy from entities in Omothol.
ac.rending.shadowgem=Shadow Gems are made from harvesting Shadow Energy from living shadows.
ac.ritual.adurationCharm=Azathoth Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.adurationCharm.desc=A Duration Azathoth Charm is made by infusion an Azathoth Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.altarOfChagarothBottom=Altar of Cha'garoth (bottom)
ac.ritual.altarOfChagarothBottom.desc=An Altar of Cha'garoth (bottom) is created with Dreadstone. Dreadium Ingots, Asorah's Dreaded Gateway Key, Bones and a piece of Dread Cloth.
ac.ritual.altarOfChagarothTop=Altar of Cha'garoth (top)
ac.ritual.altarOfChagarothTop.desc=An Altar of Cha'garoth (top) is created with Sticks, a Bucket, Dread Cloths and Dreadium Ingots.
ac.ritual.antiPotionAoE.desc=Exposes nearby entities to Liquid Antimatter. Offer 4 Rotten Anti-Flesh, 3 Water Bottles and a piece of Gunpowder.
ac.ritual.anti_air.desc=The environment around you crackles as immense power fills your body, imbuing you with the ability to fly.
ac.ritual.apowerCharm=Azathoth Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.apowerCharm.desc=A Power Azathoth Charm is made by infusion an Azathoth Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.arangeCharm=Azathoth Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.arangeCharm.desc=A Range Azathoth Charm is made by infusion an Azathoth Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.asorahGatewayKey=Asorah's Dreaded Gateway Key
ac.ritual.asorahGatewayKey.desc=Asorah's Dreaded Gateway Key is created by infusing a Gateway Key with an Eye of The Abyss, a Dreadlands Infused Powerstone and a Transmutation Gem.
ac.ritual.azathothCharm.desc=An Azathoth Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with Azathoth Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.azathothStatue.desc=An Azathoth Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Shoggoth Flesh of The Overworld (normal), Abyssal Wasteland, Dreadlands, Omothol and The Dark Realm, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.basicScroll.desc=A Basic Scroll is created with 4 Books
ac.ritual.breeding=Ritual of Fertility
ac.ritual.breeding.desc=Breeds nearby animals. Might also kill all of them, if unlucky enough.
ac.ritual.cdurationCharm=Cthulhu Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.cdurationCharm.desc=A Duration Cthulhu Charm is made by infusion a Cthulhu Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.cleansing=Ritual of Cleansing
ac.ritual.cleansing.desc=By presenting 8 random statues, a massive amount of energy and a living sacrifice, you revert the corruption of the Abyss from the surrounding area. With far too much power comes no responsibilities, what so ever. It purges the Darklands, restoring it to its pure Overworld state.
ac.ritual.corEnchantment.desc=By combining an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, Abyssal Shoggoth Flesh, Refined Coralium Ingots, Coralium-plagued Flesh and a Book, you can enchant a weapon placed on the altar with the Coralium enchantment (if applicable).
ac.ritual.corPotionAoE=Coralium Plague Infection
ac.ritual.corPotionAoE.desc=Spreads the Coralium Plague to nearby entities. Offer 4 Coralium-plagued Flesh, 3 Water Bottles and a piece of Gunpowder.
ac.ritual.corruption=Ritual of Corruption
ac.ritual.corruption.desc=By presenting 4 random statues, 4 blocks of Darkstone, a large amount of energy and a living sacrifice, you summon powers from the Abyss to corrupt the surrounding area. Defile the Overworld's purity in order to bring forth the Darklands.
ac.ritual.cpowerCharm=Cthulhu Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.cpowerCharm.desc=A Power Cthulhu Charm is made by infusion a Cthulhu Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.crangeCharm=Cthulhu Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.crangeCharm.desc=A Range Cthulhu Charm is made by infusion a Cthulhu Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.cthulhuCharm.desc=A Cthulhu Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with Cthulhu Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.cthulhuStatue.desc=A Cthulhu Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Shoggoth Flesh, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.curing=Ritual of Curing
ac.ritual.curing.desc=By presenting 4 Dread Plague Antidotes, you cure the area of the Dread Plague and the Dreadlands, restoring what was there before. The closest non-dreadlands biome will take the place of the Dreadlands.
ac.ritual.depthsBoots=Boots of The Depths
ac.ritual.depthsBoots.desc=Boots of The Depths are created by infusing a Refined Coralium Boots with 2 Coralium Gem Cluster (9 gems), Coralium-plagued Flesh, a Transmutation Gem, a Lily Pad, a Vine and a Liquid Coralium Bucket.
ac.ritual.depthsChestplate=Chestplate of The Depths
ac.ritual.depthsChestplate.desc=A Chestplate of The Depths is created by infusing a Refined Coralium Chestplate with 2 Coralium Gem Cluster (9 gems), Coralium-plagued Flesh, a Transmutation Gem, a Lily Pad, a Vine and a Liquid Coralium Bucket.
ac.ritual.depthsHelmet=Helmet of The Depths
ac.ritual.depthsHelmet.desc=A Helmet of The Depths is created by infusing a Refined Coralium Helmet with 2 Coralium Gem Cluster (9 gems), Coralium-plagued Flesh, a Transmutation Gem, a Lily Pad, a Vine and a Liquid Coralium Bucket.
ac.ritual.depthsLeggings=Leggings of The Depths
ac.ritual.depthsLeggings.desc=Leggings of The Depths are created by infusing a Refined Coralium Leggings with 2 Coralium Gem Cluster (9 gems), Coralium-plagued Flesh, a Transmutation Gem, a Lily Pad, a Vine and a Liquid Coralium Bucket.
ac.ritual.dreEnchantment.desc=By combining a Dreadlands Essence, Dreaded Shoggoth Flesh, Dreadium Ingots, Dread Fragments and a Book, you can enchant a weapon placed on the altar with the Dread enchantment (if applicable).
ac.ritual.drePotionAoE=Dread Plague Infection
ac.ritual.drePotionAoE.desc=Spreads the Dread Plague to nearby entities. Offer 4 Dread Fragments, 3 Water Bottles and a piece of Gunpowder.
ac.ritual.dreadBoots=Dreaded Abyssalnite Boots
ac.ritual.dreadBoots.desc=Dreaded Abyssalnite Boots is created by infusing Abyssalnite Boots with Dreaded Shards of Abyssalnite and a Dreadlands Essence.
ac.ritual.dreadChestplate=Dreaded Abyssalnite Chestplate
ac.ritual.dreadChestplate.desc=A Dreaded Abyssalnite Chestplate is created by infusing an Abyssalnite Chestplate with Dreaded Shards of Abyssalnite and a Dreadlands Essence.
ac.ritual.dreadHelmet=Dreaded Abyssalnite Helmet
ac.ritual.dreadHelmet.desc=A Dreaded Abyssalnite Helmet is created by infusing an Abyssalnite Helmet with Dreaded Shards of Abyssalnite and a Dreadlands Essence.
ac.ritual.dreadLeggings=Dreaded Abyssalnite Leggings
ac.ritual.dreadLeggings.desc=Dreaded Abyssalnite Leggings is created by infusing Abyssalnite Leggings with Dreaded Shards of Abyssalnite and a Dreadlands Essence.
ac.ritual.dreadSpawn=Ritual of Evolving
ac.ritual.dreadSpawn.desc=All nearby Dread Spawns (regardless of evolution stage) is cloned to produce a double. Offer a Dread Fragment, a Dreadstone, an Abyssalnite Stone, a Chunk of Abyssalnite, a Dreaded Chunk of Abyssalnite, a piece of Rotten Flesh, a Dreaded Shard of Abyssalnite and an Abyssalnite Ingot.
ac.ritual.dread_crystal.desc=Convert the power of the Dreadlands into a single crystal!
ac.ritual.durationCharm=Ritual Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.durationCharm.desc=A Duration Ritual Charm is made by infusion a Ritual Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.ecolAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Energy Collector
ac.ritual.ecolAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Energy Collector is created by infusing an Overworld Energy Collector with Abyssal Stone Bricks, Coralium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.ecolDLupgrade=Dreadlands Energy Collector
ac.ritual.ecolDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Energy Collector is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Energy Collector with Dreadstone Bricks, Abyssalnite Stone Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.ecolOMTupgrade=Omothol Energy Collector
ac.ritual.ecolOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Energy Collector is created by infusing a Dreadlands Energy Collector with Ethaxium Bricks, Dark Ethaxium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.ecolOWupgrade=Overworld Energy Collector
ac.ritual.ecolOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Energy Collector is created by infusing an Energy Collector with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.econAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Energy Container
ac.ritual.econAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Energy Container is created by infusing an Overworld Energy Container with Abyssal Stone Bricks, Coralium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.econDLupgrade=Dreadlands Energy Container
ac.ritual.econDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Energy Container is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Energy Container with Dreadstone Bricks, Abyssalnite Stone Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.econOMTupgrade=Omothol Energy Container
ac.ritual.econOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Energy Container is created by infusing a Dreadlands Energy Container with Ethaxium Bricks, Dark Ethaxium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.econOWupgrade=Overworld Energy Container
ac.ritual.econOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Energy Container is created by infusing an Energy Container with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.energyContainer.desc=Create your first PE Storage multiblock!
ac.ritual.epAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Energy Pedestal is created by infusing an Overworld Energy Pedestal with Abyssal Stone Bricks, Coralium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.epDLupgrade=Dreadlands Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Energy Pedestal is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Energy Pedestal with Dreadstone Bricks, Abyssalnite Stone Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.epOMTupgrade=Omothol Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Energy Pedestal is created by infusing a Dreadlands Energy Pedestal with Ethaxium Bricks, Dark Ethaxium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.epOWupgrade=Overworld Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Energy Pedestal is created by infusing an Energy Pedestal with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.erAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Energy Relay
ac.ritual.erAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Energy Relay is created by infusing an Overworld Energy Relay with Abyssal Stone Bricks, Coralium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.erDLupgrade=Dreadlands Energy Relay
ac.ritual.erDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Energy Relay is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Energy Relay with Dreadstone Bricks, Abyssalnite Stone Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.erOMTupgrade=Omothol Energy Relay
ac.ritual.erOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Energy Relay is created by infusing a Dreadlands Energy Relay with Ethaxium Bricks, Dark Ethaxium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.erOWupgrade=Overworld Energy Relay
ac.ritual.erOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Energy Relay is created by infusing an Energy Relay with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.ethaxiumIngot.desc=An Ethaxium Ingot is created by Infusing a Life Crystal with Ethaxium Bricks.
ac.ritual.hasturCharm.desc=A Hastur Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with Hastur Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.hasturStatue.desc=A Hastur Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Abyssal Shoggoth Flesh, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.hdurationCharm=Hastur Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.hdurationCharm.desc=A Duration Hastur Charm is made by infusion a Hastur Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.hpowerCharm=Hastur Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.hpowerCharm.desc=A Power Hastur Charm is made by infusion a Hastur Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.hrangeCharm=Hastur Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.hrangeCharm.desc=A Range Hastur Charm is made by infusion a Hastur Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.interdimensionalcage.desc=An Interdimensional Cage is created by infusing a Shard of Oblivion with Iron Bars. It can use Potential Energy to capture Entities. The amount of PE required is determined by the Entity's metric volume (ratio: 100 PE/m³), so larger entities require more PE to capture. PE is only drained when you capture an Entity.
ac.ritual.jdurationCharm=J'zahar Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.jdurationCharm.desc=A Duration J'zahar Charm is made by infusion a J'zahar Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.jpowerCharm=J'zahar Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.jpowerCharm.desc=A Power J'zahar Charm is made by infusion a J'zahar Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.jrangeCharm=J'zahar Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.jrangeCharm.desc=A Range J'zahar Charm is made by infusion a J'zahar Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.jzaharCharm.desc=A J'zahar Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with J'zahar Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.jzaharStaff=Staff of The Gatekeeper
ac.ritual.jzaharStaff.desc=A Staff of The Gatekeeper is created by infusing a Staff of Rending with an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence, an Omothol Essence, Eldritch Scales and Ethaxium Ingots.
ac.ritual.jzaharStatue.desc=A J'zahar Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Eldritch Scales, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.lesserScroll.desc=A Lesser Scroll is created with 2 Books, a Wasteland's Thorn and a Luminous Thistle
ac.ritual.massEnchantment.desc=By presesenting 8 Enchanted Books and an Item on the altar, all of the Enchantments will be combined and applied on the Item. You can use any combination of Enchantments, and all levels will be combined, so multiple instances of the same Enchantment can surpass the normal boundaries.
ac.ritual.moderateScroll.desc=A Moderate Scroll is created with 2 Books, a Dread Fragment and a Dreaded Shard of Abyssalnite
ac.ritual.ndurationCharm=Nyarlathotep Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.ndurationCharm.desc=A Duration Nyarlathotep Charm is made by infusion a Nyarlathotep Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.npowerCharm=Nyarlathotep Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.npowerCharm.desc=A Power Nyarlathotep Charm is made by infusion a Nyarlathotep Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.nrangeCharm=Nyarlathotep Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.nrangeCharm.desc=A Range Nyarlathotep Charm is made by infusion a Nyarlathotep Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.nyarlathotepCharm.desc=A Nyarlathotep Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with Nyarlathotep Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.nyarlathotepStatue.desc=A Nyarlathotep Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Dreaded Shoggoth Flesh, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.oblivionCatalyst.desc=An Oblivion Catalyst is created by infusing an Eye of Ender with Shards of Oblivion and Redstone Dust.
ac.ritual.powerCharm=Ritual Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.powerCharm.desc=A Power Ritual Charm is made by infusion a Ritual Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.powerStone=Dreadlands Infused Powerstone
ac.ritual.powerStone.desc=A Dreadlands Infused Powerstone is created by infusing Coralium Infused Stone with Dreadlands Essences.
ac.ritual.purging=Ritual of Purging
ac.ritual.purging.desc=By presenting 4 Crystallized Calcium Clusters and a large amount of energy, you purge every trace of the Dread Plague (and the Dreadlands) from the area, putting a stop to it here (also kills nearby mobs). While it renders the area uninhabitable, no plagues will be able to spread here. Doesn't work in the Dreadlands.
ac.ritual.rangeCharm=Ritual Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.rangeCharm.desc=A Range Ritual Charm is made by infusion a Ritual Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.respawnJzahar=Ritual of reversed time
ac.ritual.respawnJzahar.desc=If you in some way failed to obtain an Essence of The Gatekeeper, you can revert time and fight J'zahar again. Can only be performed at the Ritual Altar inside the Temple of J'zahar (X=4, Y=54, Z=85).
ac.ritual.resurrection.desc=By presenting crystallized compounds resembling the elements of life, a living sacrifice and a Name Tag with the name of a fallen companion, you resurrect it. The Crystal size scale with the companion (Shards for something the size of a Chicken, Clusters for a Horse, normal for anything inbetween). Life has limits, however.
ac.ritual.saAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Sacrificial Altar
ac.ritual.saAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Sacrificial Altar is created by infusing an Overworld Sacrificial Altar with Abyssal Stone Bricks, Coralium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.saDLupgrade=Dreadlands Sacrificial Altar
ac.ritual.saDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Sacrificial Altar is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Sacrificial Altar with Dreadstone Bricks, Abyssalnite Stone Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.saOMTupgrade=Omothol Sacrificial Altar
ac.ritual.saOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Sacrificial is created by infusing a Dreadlands Sacrificial Altar with Ethaxium Bricks, Dark Ethaxium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.saOWupgrade=Overworld Sacrificial Altar
ac.ritual.saOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Sacrificial Altar is created by infusing a Sacrificial Altar with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.sdurationCharm=Shub-Niggurath Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.sdurationCharm.desc=A Duration Shub-Niggurath Charm is made by infusion a Shub-Niggurath Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.shubniggurathCharm.desc=A Shub-Niggurath Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with Shub-Niggurath Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.shubniggurathStatue.desc=A Shub-Niggurath Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Shadow Shoggoth Flesh, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.sorAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Staff of Rending
ac.ritual.sorAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Staff of Rending is created by infusing a Staff of Rending with Abyssal Stone, Coralium-plagued Flesh and and a Shadow Gem.
ac.ritual.sorDLupgrade=Dreadlands Staff of Rending
ac.ritual.sorDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Staff of Rending is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Staff of Rending with Dreadstone, Dread Fragment and and a Shadow Gem.
ac.ritual.sorOMTupgrade=Omothol Staff of Rending
ac.ritual.sorOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Staff of Rending is created by infusing a Dreadlands Staff of Rending with Omothol Stone, Omothol Flesh and and a Shadow Gem.
ac.ritual.spiritTablet.desc=A Spirit Tablet is created by infusing a Life Crystal with 4 Spirit Tablet Shards. It's a tool that allows you to move Items between Blocks by having the Items move on their own. Read more about it in the Omothol section of the book.
ac.ritual.spowerCharm=Shub-Niggurath Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.spowerCharm.desc=A Power Shub-Niggurath Charm is made by infusion a Shub-Niggurath Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.srangeCharm=Shub-Niggurath Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.srangeCharm.desc=A Range Shub-Niggurath Charm is made by infusion a Shub-Niggurath Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.summonAsorah=Ritual of The Sleeper
ac.ritual.summonAsorah.desc=Summons Asorah, The Fallen, from the Dark Realm. The afterlife is commonly referred to as an eternal slumber, in which a sleeper is an entity beyond life and death. Requires a pristine Transmutation Gem.
ac.ritual.summonSacthoth=Ritual of Shadows
ac.ritual.summonSacthoth.desc=Summons Sacthoth, Harbinger of Doom, from the Dark Realm. Offer him your most valuable items and as much PE as you can hold... Maybe he'll appear...
ac.ritual.transmutationGem.desc=The Transmutation Gem is an essential ingredient with 10 durability that can transform various materials into more AbyssalCraft items.
ac.ritual.weather=Ritual of Downpour
ac.ritual.weather.desc=By sacrificing 8 Feathers, you can control the weather of the Biome you're inside (provided it can rain there). If it's not raining, it will rain. If it's raining, it will start thundering. If it's thundering the rain and thunder will cease.
ac.ritual.ydurationCharm=Yog-Sothoth Charm (Duration)
ac.ritual.ydurationCharm.desc=A Duration Yog-Sothoth Charm is made by infusion a Yog-Sothoth Charm with Redstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.yogsothothCharm.desc=A Yog-Sothoth Charm is made by infusing a Ritual Charm with Yog-Sothoth Engraved Coins.
ac.ritual.yogsothothStatue.desc=A Yog-Sothoth Statue is created by infusing a Monolith Stone with Omothol Shoggoth Flesh, an Abyssal Wasteland Essence, a Dreadlands Essence and an Omothol Essence.
ac.ritual.ypowerCharm=Yog-Sothoth Charm (Power)
ac.ritual.ypowerCharm.desc=A Power Yog-Sothoth Charm is made by infusion a Yog-Sothoth Charm with Glowstone Dust and Shadow Fragments.
ac.ritual.yrangeCharm=Yog-Sothoth Charm (Range)
ac.ritual.yrangeCharm.desc=A Range Yog-Sothoth Charm is made by infusion a Yog-Sothoth Charm with Arrows and Shadow Fragments.
ac.spell.detachment.desc=Removes one piece of equipment from the target causing it to fall on the ground. Equipped item is chosen randomly from among its equipped/held items.
ac.spell.displayRoutes.desc=Reveals any active Item transport routes within 16 blocks of the caster.
ac.spell.entropy.desc=Draw energy straight from the ground as it crumbles to dust.
ac.spell.floating.desc=As long as you're casting the spell, you're as light as a feather, allowing you to walk on air. Who needs gravity anyways?
ac.spell.graspofcthulhu=Grasp of Cthulhu
ac.spell.graspofcthulhu.desc=Damages the target over time while holding them in place. The damage can never reduce the target to 0HP or less
ac.spell.invisibility=Hide from the Eye
ac.spell.invisibility.desc=Caster or target goes Invisible for 5 minutes.
ac.spell.lifedrain.desc=Siphon the lifeforce of your enemy to heal your wounds.
ac.spell.mining.desc=Superheat the ground in a straight line, melting any stone and leaving all ores intact.
ac.spell.oozeremoval.desc=Disperses any Shoggoth Ooze in the vicinity of the caster.
ac.spell.sirenssong.desc=By singing to a creature's very soul you encourage it to join your team. (Useless on Players.)
ac.spell.stealvigor.desc=The target is temporarily weakened while the caster claims their strength.
ac.spell.teleportHome=When cast, teleports you back to your spawn point from wherever you are (including other dimensions).
ac.spell.teleporthostiles.desc=By sacrificing the life of an innocent child, the dark ones are pushed away. Cast the spell while targeting an animal baby, and all mobs within 50 blocks will be teleported away from you.
ac.spell.toggleState=Toll The Bell
ac.spell.toggleState.desc=Starts/stops the Item transportation of all blocks within a 16 block radius of the player (or the block they're looking at).
ac.spell.undeathtodust=Undeath to Dust
ac.spell.undeathtodust.desc=Instantly disintegrate one undead creature, leaving nothing behind.
ac.structure.archway.blocks=6x Wall Block (any);4x Stair Block (any);6x Slab Block (any);1x Statue (any);1x Monolith Stone
ac.structure.archway.description=A small piece that can be used in a decorative manner. Any stair, slab and wall blocks can be used to form it.
ac.structure.basic.blocks=15x Monolith Stone;4x Monolith Stone Pillar;4x Statue (any)
ac.structure.basic.description=A small and simple shrine. Provides a range boost to affected statues.
ac.structure.totempole.blocks=3x Statue (any);1x Monolith Stone
ac.structure.totempole.description=Now you just need a campfire, some instruments and a jingle dress!
