message.jzahar.banish.ac=Ahem... I thought I gave you an assignment aeons ago, did it ever occur to you that it was permanent?
message.jzahar.banish.jzh=There can only be ONE! *Creates sword out of thin air*
message.jzahar.banish.other=I don't believe we've been acquainted, I'm the one that banishes you from this dimension.
message.jzahar.banish.vanilla=I never asked to be within the same dimension as you. Begone, foul beast!
message.jzahar.creative.1=%s, you do realize I could simply switch your Gamemode and slaughter you right now? I'm that kind of Entity.
message.jzahar.creative.2=But yeah... that would technically be cheating, so I'll just stick to the "rules" and do nothing.
message.jzahar.death.1=Congratulations, you "killed" me. No, not even close. You CAN'T kill a Great Old One.
message.jzahar.death.10=If you survived the blast, take this mere fragment of my being, it will give you access to the Abyssalnomicon.
message.jzahar.death.2=What you killed is a simulacrum (a mere physical incarnation of infinite darkness). Some call it a puppet.
message.jzahar.death.3=Something that escapes a human when they delve into madness is the concept of reality.
message.jzahar.death.4=An example of this is you believing that you've slain a Great Old One.
message.jzahar.death.5=Any sane person would realize that going after such a powerful being is nothing but certain death.
message.jzahar.death.6=But you... your mind has been twisting itself harder the more knowledge you've gained.
message.jzahar.death.7=The fact that you thought for a second that you had killed me shows just how insane you've become.
message.jzahar.death.8=My readings have already led you here, so wouldn't you want more knowledge. Perhaps death is what you truly desire.
message.jzahar.death.9=Let me unleash the last power contained within this hollow puppet. It'll give me the answer.
message.jzahar.respawn=I sense time was turned back. Did you fail to defeat me, %s?
message.necronomicon.nope=It appears that you don't own this book. Ever thought about not trying to read it?
message.portalplacer.error.1=You feel a presence of denial, J'zahar does not approve.
message.portalplacer.error.2=Nothing happened...
